1
00:00:00,097 --> 00:00:04,057
(Howard:)If I may abruptly change the subject,
did you and Penny finally...? You know.

2
00:00:04,226 --> 00:00:05,436
(Scene:)-Howard.
-I don't care...

3
00:00:05,603 --> 00:00:08,193
(Howard:)...but my genitals wanted me to ask.

4
00:00:08,689 --> 00:00:11,859
(Leonard:)Tell your genitals what I do with Penny
is none of their business.

5
00:00:13,194 --> 00:00:15,524
(Howard(to his genitals):)He says they didn't do it.

6
00:00:16,989 --> 00:00:18,779
(Leonard(to Sheldon, entering):)Sheldon, over here.

7
00:00:28,084 --> 00:00:29,414
[CHOKING]

8
00:00:33,172 --> 00:00:34,422
(Howard:)What are you doing?

9
00:00:35,466 --> 00:00:37,846
Well, I feel bad for the guy.

10
00:00:40,763 --> 00:00:42,763
(Leonard:)Sheldon, why are you sitting
by yourself?

11
00:00:42,932 --> 00:00:44,472
(Sheldon:)Because I am without friends.

12
00:00:44,642 --> 00:00:48,142
(Sheldon:)Like the proverbial cheese,
I stand alone.

13
00:00:48,312 --> 00:00:50,022
(Sheldon:)Even while seated.

14
00:00:50,189 --> 00:00:51,939
(Leonard:)Come on. We said we were sorry.

15
00:00:52,108 --> 00:00:54,188
(Sheldon:)It's going to take more
than an "I'm sorry"...

16
00:00:54,360 --> 00:00:58,450
...and an apology pie from Penny
to make up for what you've done to me.

17
00:00:58,614 --> 00:01:01,074
(Kripke(arriving):)Hey, Cooper.
Read your retraction e-mail.

